{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21802","headline":"有鸟二十章 十六 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟毛羽黄，雄者爲鸳雌者鸯。\n主人幷养七十二，罗列雕笼开洞房。\n雄鸣一声雌鼓翼，夜不得栖朝不食。\n气息榻然双翅垂，犹入笼中就颜色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}